        "accession_number": "0001753926-26-000462",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are implementing a multi-brand strategy, facilitated by our in house developed scalable content management system and frontend that allows us to scale our business by duplicating our Platform strengths across multiple domains with individualized branding and different target markets.",
        "start_character": 9457,
        "end_character": 9744
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001753926-26-000462",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001753926-26-000462-25b1aa58eea3285b",
        "accession_number": "0001753926-26-000462",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that this multi-brand strategy allows us to compete for increased market share in markets where players have accounts with multiple iCasino operators by offering a selection of brands that target different demographics in addition to launching new brands that are locally targeted.",
        "start_character": 9745,
        "end_character": 10037
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001753926-26-000462",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001753926-26-000462-25b1aa58eea3285b",
        "accession_number": "0001753926-26-000462",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We intend to achieve rapid, cost efficient and sustainable growth by utilizing high margin cash flow generated from online casino operations in our current international markets where we operate and to enter and grow sustainable revenues in newly regulated and soon to be regulated markets.",
        "start_character": 9166,
        "end_character": 9456
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001753926-26-000462",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001753926-26-000462-25b1aa58eea3285b",
        "accession_number": "0001753926-26-000462",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate in a mix of remote licensed markets, which we refer to as Pre-regulated markets, where we may reasonably operate using international licenses, as well as locally licensed markets, which we refer to as Regulated markets, requiring a local license.",
        "start_character": 3969,
        "end_character": 4226
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001753926-26-000462",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001753926-26-000462-25b1aa58eea3285b",
        "accession_number": "0001753926-26-000462",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We previously operated our legacy CasinoRoom.com iCasino operations in a number of Pre-regulated markets through a previously held gaming license in Malta.",
        "start_character": 12607,
        "end_character": 12762
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001753926-26-000462",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001753926-26-000462-25b1aa58eea3285b",
        "accession_number": "0001753926-26-000462",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are an evolving and growth-oriented online iCasino operator of business-to-consumer (B2C) brands, leveraging its online operational and marketing expertise and assets as the foundation for what we believe to be a highly competitive growth model.",
        "start_character": 11117,
        "end_character": 11365
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001753926-26-000462",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001753926-26-000462-25b1aa58eea3285b",
        "accession_number": "0001753926-26-000462",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are able to use proceeds from operations in Pre-regulated markets to invest into Regulated markets building long-term sustainable profits.",
        "start_character": 12465,
        "end_character": 12606
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001753926-26-000462",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001753926-26-000462-25b1aa58eea3285b",
        "accession_number": "0001753926-26-000462",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We expect that we will be able to launch competitive new brands as we identify opportunities in our existing markets or new markets.",
        "start_character": 10038,
        "end_character": 10170
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001753926-26-000462",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001753926-26-000462-25b1aa58eea3285b",
        "accession_number": "0001753926-26-000462",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We plan to launch into one or more locally regulated markets, the first of which is Ontario.",
        "start_character": 4227,
        "end_character": 4319
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001753926-26-000462",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001753926-26-000462-25b1aa58eea3285b",
        "accession_number": "0001753926-26-000462",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We successfully launched Fruta.com in our existing markets throughout 2024, using our existing resources and gaming licenses.",
        "start_character": 10171,
        "end_character": 10296
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001753926-26-000462",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001753926-26-000462-25b1aa58eea3285b",
        "accession_number": "0001753926-26-000462",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "While we plan to focus our resources on growing and improving our existing brands and entering new markets, we believe that the scalability of our Platform will continue to allow the Company to launch and support additional brands, if necessary, with our existing resources.",
